  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened Accountability for Climate Action (SACA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthened Accountability for Climate Action (SACA) project&apos;s long term development objectives is to contribute to climate-resilient communities in West Pokot county, Kenya through youth led climate action, sustainable farming and enhanced civic participation. Through capacity building, cross-cultural collaboration, and civic engagement, the project strengthens youth, local leaders, and climate champions to advocate for climate-responsive investments and monitor climate finance. It fosters stronger, more transparent engagement between governments and citizens, ensuring climate impacts are included in planning and budgeting. SACA promotes locally led adaptation interventions and moves policy commitments into real action.</narrative>
  </description>
